//! Amplifiers (manual 4.11): each a node shape, and its variants by its options (`noinv input up`…),
//! named `op amp|noinv input up`; their `+` and `-` are the glyphs' outlines. Each is measured too
//! with each of its sizes changed (`op amp@width`, at `default + step`), and with the pairs of them
//! that change it together (`op amp@width+port width`), and drawn in between.
//!
//! Measured on what CircuiTikZ 1.8.7 draws (`tools/oracle/`), at the default size, in
//! `bipoles/length`; the text goes in the middle and does not count in the picture's size.

